The Gemma tokenizer (tokenizer.json of the model above) is redistributed in static/engine/tokenizer/ in a compact
binary form made by tools/compacter_tokenizer.py: the same single-character tokens, byte-fallback tokens, added
tokens and merge rules, stored as numbers instead of JSON. It gives the same token ids as the original file.

